> execute at qa as @e[type=minecraft:rabbit,distance=..96] run data get entity @s CustomName
reject Accessing LegacyRandomSource from multiple threads
expect creativeengineering:named_mob": 2b
look every cow/sheep/pig answer is a name ("has the following entity data"); rabbits "Found no elements"; no animals at all = locate plains from another far origin

## SQ-NM-02 | command spawns never roll
